---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { pagePath } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Mill City Web Studio" description="About Mill City Web Studio, a Minneapolis web studio founded by a software engineer with 20+ years of experience.">
  <section class="section-shell page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Experienced engineering for your small business.</h1>
    <p>I started Mill City Web Studio to support other small-business owners with a more personal path to a professional website.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell about-grid">
    <div class="about-stat"><strong>20+</strong><span>years working in software engineering</span></div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="lede">I'm a Minneapolis-based software engineer with 20+ years of experience. Mill City Web Studio is where I bring that experience to smaller, more personal website projects.</p>
      <p>Clients work directly with me from the first conversation through launch and support.</p>
      <p>My focus is simple: bring your small-business brand to life online with a site that looks professional, works well on desktop and mobile, and supports the business behind it.</p>
      <p>The Mill City name is personal too. My wife and I got engaged on the Stone Arch Bridge and were married nearby at St. Anthony Main.</p>
      <p>Today we're raising three kids in Minneapolis and spending plenty of time around youth sports, the Timberwolves, and the Twins.</p>
      <a class="button secondary" href={pagePath('contact/')}>Submit a request</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell about-photos" aria-label="Personal photos">
    <figure class="photo-placeholder family-photo">
      <img class="family-photo-image" src={pagePath('maddens-family.jpg')} alt="Family at Madden's Resort in Minnesota" />
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Madden’s Resort</strong>
        <span>Minnesota summers with the family.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="photo-placeholder family-photo">
      <img class="family-photo-image" src={pagePath('giants-ridge-family.jpg')} alt="Family skiing at Giants Ridge in Minnesota" />
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Giants Ridge</strong>
        <span>A winter day on the slopes.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell mill-city-story">
    <figure class="mill-city-story-media">
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Gold_Medal_Flour-Mill_City-2007-03-12.jpg" alt="Gold Medal Flour sign and historic mill buildings in Minneapolis" />
      <blockquote>Old character.<br />New purpose.</blockquote>
      <figcaption>
        Gold Medal Flour · Minneapolis · Photo via
        <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gold_Medal_Flour-Mill_City-2007-03-12.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons</a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="mill-city-story-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">The Mill City story</div>
      <h2>Old character. New purpose.</h2>
      <p>Mill City is rooted in Minneapolis — its flour mills, riverfront industry, and historic spaces. The Gold Medal Flour sign captures that mix of old and new, and that same idea shapes the studio: bringing the story and personality behind a business into a modern website built for what’s next.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell principles">
    <div class="eyebrow">How I work</div>
    <div class="card-grid three">
      <article><h3>Keep it simple</h3><p>No unnecessary jargon, bloated process, or mystery around what is being built and why.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Build it properly</h3><p>A polished front end supported by a sensible technical foundation and a maintainable workflow.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Make it useful</h3><p>The site should earn trust, answer real customer questions, and make the next step obvious.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .family-photo-image{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
    object-fit:contain;
    object-position:center;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
    border-radius:16px;
  }
  .mill-city-story{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
    gap:4rem;
    align-items:center;
    padding:5rem 0;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  }
  .mill-city-story-media{
    position:relative;
    margin:0;
    min-height:440px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:4px;
    background:#11181d;
  }
  .mill-city-story-media:after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,8,10,.08),rgba(5,8,10,.72));
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .mill-city-story-media img{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:440px;
    object-fit:cover;
    filter:saturate(.78) contrast(1.03);
  }
  .mill-city-story-media blockquote{
    position:absolute;
    z-index:1;
    left:2rem;
    bottom:2.5rem;
    margin:0;
    max-width:10ch;
    color:#fff7ec;
    font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.7rem);
    line-height:.98;
    letter-spacing:-.03em;
  }
  .mill-city-story-media figcaption{
    position:absolute;
    z-index:2;
    left:1rem;
    bottom:.7rem;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);
    font-size:.62rem;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
  }
  .mill-city-story-media figcaption a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
  .mill-city-story-copy h2{max-width:12ch}
  .mill-city-story-copy p{color:var(--soft);max-width:34rem}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .family-photo-image{min-height:0}
    .mill-city-story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem;padding:4rem 0}
    .mill-city-story-media,.mill-city-story-media img{min-height:360px;height:360px}
  }
</style>
